1
00:00:00,803 --> 00:00:03,053
No, Wil Wheaton
is Sheldon's mortal enemy.

2
00:00:03,222 --> 00:00:05,062
(Amy:)- Mortal enemy?
- Mm-hm.

3
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:08,434
(Amy:)Sheldon, I know you're a bit
of a left-handed monkey wrench but...

4
00:00:09,646 --> 00:00:13,486
(Amy:)- You really have a mortal enemy?
- ln fact, I have 61 of them.

5
00:00:15,193 --> 00:00:18,403
(Sheldon:)- Would you like to see the list?
- Oh, say no, say no, say no, say no.

6
00:00:19,238 --> 00:00:21,908
(Sheldon:)You just got off the list.
Would you like back on it?

7
00:00:24,452 --> 00:00:29,372
(Sheldon:)This'll just take a moment.
It's on a five and a quarter inch floppy.

8
00:00:35,171 --> 00:00:39,421
- A floppy disk?
- Well, I started the list when I was 9.

9
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:41,717
(Amy:)How did wil wheaton get on the list?

10
00:00:41,886 --> 00:00:43,266
(All:)Oh, God.
Come on.

11
00:00:43,846 --> 00:00:46,556
As a child, I Ioved Wesley Crusher...

12
00:00:46,724 --> 00:00:48,604
(Sheldon:)...Wil Wheaton's character
on Star Trek.

13
00:00:48,768 --> 00:00:51,688
(Sheldon:)So I drove for hours by bus
to a Star Trek convention...

14
00:00:51,854 --> 00:00:54,234
(Sheldon:)...at which Wil Wheaton
was scheduled to appear...

15
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:57,399
(Sheldon:)...so that I could get
my Wesley Crusher action figure signed.

16
00:00:57,568 --> 00:00:58,648
(Sheldon:)But he never showed...

17
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,280
(Sheldon:)...because apparently,
it was "cooler" for him...

